				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1952650/elder-baconator#post-4004414</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 26 Sep 2018 18:00:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Bezerker</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4648375</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>As a sandwich worker at Wendy's, I can confirm that you CAN in fact order a Baconator Triple with an extra patty, effectively making the Elder Baconator.</p> <p>Just a few things that stuck out (which don't make it any less funny), as the cashier violated MANY company regulations:</p> <ol> <li>You don't start off a conversation with a customer by suggesting a particular item.</li> <li>If handed anything that exceeds a $20 bill, a manager has to run the bill through a counterfeit checker</li> <li>AT MOST, the Baconator Elder is around 2-4$ more than a normal Baconator.</li> </ol> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
